      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="strip lh-bar" id="lhBar"></div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="rift">
  <div class="card glow">
    <div class="hero-timer">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Spacetime Rift <span class="srv-badge" id="riftSrv">TW</span></div>
        <div class="row rift-stat-row"><div id="riftStatus" class="status"><span class="dot"></span><span id="riftStatusText">Loading</span></div><button type="button" class="btn small" id="riftInfoBtn" aria-haspopup="dialog">Spacetime Rift: Explained</button></div>
        <div class="big mono" id="riftBig">--:--:--</div>
        <div class="muted" id="riftSub">Next portal opens at --</div>
        <div class="row" style="margin-top:14px">
          <button class="btn primary" id="riftNotifyBtn">Enable browser alerts</button>
          <button class="btn" type="button" data-open-settings="sound">Enable Sound Alerts</button>
          <button class="btn" id="testSoundBtn">Test sound</button>
          <button class="btn" id="popoutBtn" title="Compact always-on-top style window, also works as an OBS browser source">Pop out / OBS overlay</button>
        </div>
        <p class="subtle" style="margin:12px 0 0">Portals open every 3 hours at 02:00, 05:00, 08:00, 11:00, 14:00, 17:00, 20:00 and 23:00 server time. The entry portal stays open for about 10 minutes; once inside, the rift window lasts up to 1 hour. Level 45+. Watch the in-game countdown for the exact close.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Today's rift openings <span class="subtle" style="text-transform:none;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:500" id="riftDayLabel"></span></div>
        <div class="sched-list" id="riftSched"></div>
        <p class="subtle" style="margin:12px 0 0">Times shown in <span id="tzLabelRift">your local time</span>. Korea and Taiwan share the same clock schedule but run one hour apart. If a countdown looks an hour off, check your server and time zone in Settings.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

