    <div class="row"><span class="subtle">Built on NCSOFT's official game data and probability tables</span></div>
  </div>
  <a class="discord-card" href="https://discord.gg/aion2global" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.3 4.4A19.8 19.8 0 0 0 15.4 3l-.6 1.3a18.3 18.3 0 0 0-5.6 0L8.6 3a19.7 19.7 0 0 0-4.9 1.4C.6 9 0 13.5.3 18a19.9 19.9 0 0 0 6 3l1.3-2.1a12.9 12.9 0 0 1-2-1l.5-.4a14.2 14.2 0 0 0 12 0l.5.4a12.8 12.8 0 0 1-2 1l1.3 2.1a19.8 19.8 0 0 0 6-3c.4-5.2-.7-9.7-3-13.6zM8.5 15.3c-1.2 0-2.1-1.1-2.1-2.4s.9-2.4 2.1-2.4 2.2 1.1 2.1 2.4c0 1.3-.9 2.4-2.1 2.4zm7 0c-1.2 0-2.1-1.1-2.1-2.4s.9-2.4 2.1-2.4 2.2 1.1 2.1 2.4c0 1.3-.9 2.4-2.1 2.4z"/></svg><div><b>Join the AION 2 Global Community Discord</b><span>The community hub for global players: news, guides, group finding and the community tools list.</span></div><span class="go">discord.gg/aion2global</span></a>
  <div class="tools-group"><h3>Plan your character</h3><div class="tools-grid">
    <a class="tool-card" href="/planner/"><b>Build Planner</b><span>Skills, stigmas, gear, Daevanion and Arcana from official data, with character import and share links.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/where-do-i-stand/"><b>Where Do I Stand?</b><span>Put your combat power against thousands of level 50 characters: your percentile overall, for your class and on your server, plus which classes people actually play.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/server-strength/"><b>Server Strength</b><span>How every Korean and Taiwanese server compares on combat power, and how the two factions stack up, from thousands of level 50 characters we index.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/steam/"><b>Steam Players</b><span>How many people are in Aion 2 on Steam right now, 24 hour and daily peaks, the review score, Founder's Pack and PC requirements, from Steam's official data.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/armory/"><b>Armory</b><span>Look up any Korea or Taiwan character: gear, stats, skills and Daevanion, and compare characters side by side.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/calculator/"><b>Stat calculators</b><span>Which stat to raise next for damage, and the Combat Speed breakpoints for your class.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/enhance/"><b>Enhancement cost simulator</b><span>Expected and worst-case Kina and stones for enhancement, breakthrough, runes and wings, with the official pity rules.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/options/"><b>Option odds</b><span>Soul imprint options with a rate-my-roll checker, plus Arcana, pet understanding and manastone odds.</span></a>
  </div></div>
  <div class="tools-group"><h3>Find items</h3><div class="tools-grid">
    <a class="tool-card" href="/db/"><b>Database</b><span>All 13,000+ items, gear stats at any enhancement, skills, Arcana, Daevanion nodes and theostones.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/dungeons/"><b>Dungeon hub</b><span>Every Expedition, Transcendence and Sanctuary dungeon with bosses, official entry rules and top drops.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/sets/"><b>Equipment set bonuses</b><span>Abyss gear sets with official 2 to 12 piece bonuses and a pieces-owned checker.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/drops/"><b>Drop and source finder</b><span>Search an item to see every boss, Hidden Cube, Shugo Festa reward and chest that gives it, with official rates.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/crafting/"><b>Crafting helper</b><span>Craft success by proficiency level gap, combo chances and every material conversion recipe.</span></a>
