    <a class="tool-card" href="/community-tools/"><b>Community tools and DPS meters</b><span>DPS meters, maps, leaderboards and planners made by other players, with what each one does and the risks to know.</span></a>
    <a class="tool-card" href="/guide/"><b>New player guide</b><span>Everything to know before and after launch, with beginner tips from community videos.</span></a>
  </div></div>
